                "Mahalwari Settlement covered ~30% of British Indian territory (North-Western Provinces, Central Provinces, Punjab).",
                "Permanent Settlement: Settlement made with Zamindars; Revenue fixed in perpetuity.",
                "Ryotwari Settlement: Settlement made directly with individual Ryots; Revenue periodically revised (every 20–30 years).",
                "Mahalwari Settlement: Settlement made with Village Community (Mahal); Revenue periodically revised (every 20–30 years).",
